  "id": "social-emotion",
  "term": "social emotion",
  "definition": "A social emotion is an emotion oriented toward society and other people. It has both positive and negative dimensions: positive social emotion reflects constructive, engaged feelings that support prosocial and harmonious relationships, while negative social emotion involves dissatisfied, anxious, restless, or disengaged responses to social conditions that can weaken connection and adjustment.",
